        "text": "Two related things:\n\u2022 The <https://liveprog.org/|LIVE Workshop> deadline is July 21st, so there\u2019s still plenty of time to get a submission together! Please let me know if you have any questions, or want to talk about a submission.\n\u2022 I\u2019ve been cooking up a <https://live-workshop.github.io/primer/|LIVE Primer>. It\u2019s an overview of LIVE-adjacent research \u2013 mapping out some territory, sharing some advice, &amp; curating some citations. It\u2019s rough right now, but I think there\u2019s good stuff in there already. Please take a look and let me know what you think. (_Especially_ if there\u2019s something you wish was in there that isn\u2019t; that would be great to know.)\nThanks!",
